            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Lovers Hang Ga",
            "review_text": "Kim L\nAarhus, Denmark250 contributions\n0\nVISIT THAT PLACE!\nAug 2025 • Couples\nAfter a long trip, we were hungry, and both wanted pizza.\nA quick search on maps and we found Pizza Lovers 60 m from our hotel.\nSuper cute staff. Ordered a pizza each, and once pommes frites.\nREALLY good pizzas both 2 and a great time fries. The whole mega hot, and crazy delicious crisp bottom on pizza as well as fries.\nWe are 100% back!\nRead more\nTranslated from Danish\nShow original\nWritten August 20, 2025",
