            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Lovers Hang Ga",
            "review_text": "Eugene Nyunt\nBangkok, Thailand956 contributions\n0\n🇵🇸⚖️🇿🇦🌏🌍🌎🇵🇸 🪴 Delectable Vegan جبنة 🧀 Cheese Pizza! 🇵🇸🔻🕊️❤️\nAug 2024 • Solo\n🇵🇸🔻⚖️🕊️🔻 I’ve been here several times and I love both the service and the attentiveness to the taste and value of the 🌿vegan cheese pizza. ⚖️🇿🇦 🕊️🇪🇸🇵🇸 Other items rely on murdering animals or using their secretions. I would recommend the medium-sized version of the vegan cheese pizza 🇵🇸 - particularly if you’re dining alone, are especially hungry and are not having any sides. 🇵🇸🇲🇲🇵🇸🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿🇵🇸❤️ It will be more than enough! If you order the fries, these are more like wedges and are very pleasant too, but a word of warning - they come with separate servings of بندورة 🍅 tomato ketchup and mayonnaise, the latter of which may not itself be vegan. 🇵🇸🌿🇻🇳🇵🇸 I suggest just asking for ketchup instead. An Apartheid-free Palestine, from the Jordan River to the Mediterranean Sea, this pizzeria is welcoming to everyone 🧕🏽🔻🍉🌿🕊️🧔🏻‍♀️🇻🇳🔻🇵🇸!\nRead more\nWritten August 21, 2024",
